[
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0040#4",
    "text": "我口味变了，现在最爱吃饺子。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0041#0",
    "text": "For drinks, oolong tea is my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0041#1",
    "text": "My favourite is still oolong tea."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0041#2",
    "text": "I'm also a fan of lemonade."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0041#3",
    "text": "I was just watching a video on hot chocolate."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0041#4",
    "text": "Actually, I meant to say coffee is my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0042#0",
    "text": "椰子水是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0042#1",
    "text": "我的最爱依然是椰子水。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0043#0",
    "text": "For me, cycling is the best."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0043#1",
    "text": "I walked by a shop today that was full of badminton stuff."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0043#2",
    "text": "I'm into badminton as well."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0043#3",
    "text": "My favourite is still cycling."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0043#4",
    "text": "My mum likes badminton best."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0044#0",
    "text": "我住在北京这边。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0044#1",
    "text": "我家就在厦门。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0044#2",
    "text": "我已经搬去深圳生活了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0044#3",
    "text": "我已经把家搬到成都了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0045#0",
    "text": "For me, oolong tea is the best drink."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0045#1",
    "text": "Coffee could be the one I like more; I'm still unsure."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0046#0",
    "text": "豆浆是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0046#1",
    "text": "我妈最爱喝咖啡。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0047#0",
    "text": "For flowers, sunflowers are my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0047#1",
    "text": "I also think orchids are lovely."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0047#2",
    "text": "Lately, tulips have become my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0047#3",
    "text": "I'm not sure whether I like orchids more."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0048#0",
    "text": "我长住北京。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0048#1",
    "text": "我家安在厦门。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0048#2",
    "text": "上星期我到上海出了趟差。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0048#3",
    "text": "我说不准会不会搬去上海。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0048#4",
    "text": "明年说不定会去深圳住，还没想好。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0049#0",
    "text": "My top drink is oolong tea."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0049#1",
    "text": "Green tea could be my favourite, but I can't really tell."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0050#0",
    "text": "铃兰是我最喜欢的花。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0050#1",
    "text": "刚看到一个介绍绣球花的视频。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0050#2",
    "text": "百合好像也挺好，没准我更喜欢它。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0050#3",
    "text": "要说花的话，绣球花是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0050#4",
    "text": "现在我的最爱换成栀子花了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0051#0",
    "text": "The sport I like most is climbing."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0051#1",
    "text": "I've switched favourites; badminton tops the list now."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0052#0",
    "text": "运动里面，我最喜欢游泳。"
  }
]
